Z||000000||Urchin||08-27-2001||01:51 AM||||I was just flipping through the channels and came across a stolen vehicle pursuit on Real TV, which yes, turned out to be a fiero.  It was a red fastback.  They ended up using the spike strip and the "fishtail manuver" to stop him.  Very cool to see.  I wish I had a tape handy to record it.  Anyone else see this?<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/side_cut_sig_4.jpg">  <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
